Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.43,0:01:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。Mills，how are you？- I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How are you？- Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I suppose you wanna see it again？- Lf you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.77,0:01:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know where it is。- Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I charged you a dollar every time you came to examine the machine…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.73,0:01:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you'd probably own it。It's the one all the pros use.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mariah Carey。Beyonce。Gwen Stefani.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？Who's Beyonce？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just kidding。I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，sir。The adult party's in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm Kim's father。- Excuse me，I work for her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.99,0:02:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Her real father。- It's okay，Cyril。I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello，Bryan。- Lenore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just wanted to give Kim her present.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're letting the kids have their space.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Put it with the others。- I wanna give it to her myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Still having trouble following the rules。- Oh，come on，Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.93,0:03:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've asked you not to call me that。- Excuse me。Lenore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad！- Oh，my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。- Hello，my sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Happy birthday。- I was telling your father…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …how we arranged the presents。- Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's bad manners to open the one…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …and not the others。- Go on。Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cool。- A karaoke machine？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，I figured she wants to be a singer。- When she was 12，Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We've moved on。- Thank you，Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I still wanna be a singer。Don't tell Mom。- You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here。One for the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We have a professional photographer。- Big smile，sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！Oh，my God！Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my… Stuart！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart，I love you！I love you！I love you！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Happy birthday，sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，Stuart，you're impossible。- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Bryan。- Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's not a little girl anymore，huh？- I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Will you join us for lunch？- No，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just wanted to be here to wish her a happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good to see you，Bryan。- You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not like I didn't call to remind you。Third Saturday in May？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Red meat，red wine？Sound familiar？- He probably had a lot on his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，the busy life of a retiree。Every day a new adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,What does a retiree do，anyway？Take naps？Play golf？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hit on rich widows？- That takes care of the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，come on，guys。You know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，how's that going？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。We had her birthday today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you believe my Kimmy's 17？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seventeen？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- To Kim。- Lennie still got a hard-on for you？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:06:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's not Lennie anymore。She's Lenore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，she's still got a hard-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And the husband？- The same。Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dig deep enough，there's always shit。- We can dig if you want us to dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，you think he hasn't done it already？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Bernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How's Kimmy？- Good。She's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.53,0:06:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？She sleep over yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，let's say we're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,She appreciate the fact that you've given up your life…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in order to be closer to her？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a life，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，remember Beirut after the chief disappeared？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bry was in deep with that crazy sheik from Hezbollah？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guy said he'd get us inside then disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're scrambling to get the hell out…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…before we get taken down and where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I promised never to miss her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.85,0:06:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that went down well at Langley…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…when they found out you flew the coop…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to attend your child's birthday 9000 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where did you say your next posting was？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Arctic Circle spying on penguins，I believe it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，penguins live in Antarctica.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，it was Alaska。What's your point，Sam？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,My point is we have an open space。Say the word，it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who likes theirs rare？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Guys。- See you，Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good night，guys。- See you，Bry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look，look，look。All kidding aside…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…it's a great thing trying to make up for lost time with Kimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,But tomorrow's job？Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four hours' work，2500 bucks…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…just for taking some pop diva to and from her concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're one short。- A singer？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know if you'd call her a singer。More like a cash cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty million records sold already and she's not even 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Job's a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,We get her there and back。Inside，they've got their own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- Okay。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Like that's it？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It'll be perfect。Just like old times。- Better。No one gets killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tomorrow。Good night，guys。- See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get in the back，Wendy。- I always get in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ma'am，if you don't mind，I suggest you keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mother is ma'am，if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，it's time now。Let's go。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bernie，Casey，you're out here。Bry，you're in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，let's go，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.69,0:09:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，it was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks。What did you say your name was again？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mills。Bryan Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice to meet you，Bryan Mills。- You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're on。Come on，let's go now。- Okay，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've a daughter who wants to be a singer and was wondering if you had any tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell her to pick another career.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got one。We're waiting on an air strike…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and we're waiting and then my satellite phone rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who is it？- Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The guy we're to terminate。- Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He'd like to know if we want some tea。- Sorry，guys，it's Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,The noise？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm at a concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know this song？Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep，that's her。No，no，no，I'm not attending.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm… I'm not attending.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm helping some friends out with security.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，of course I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who do you think's guarding her？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I'm happy you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm happy you called。What？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lunch？Tomorrow？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure，sure。I know the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twelve-thirty it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here he is。And？- What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She wants to have lunch。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just the two of us。- All right。Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？There's progress。That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who left that gate open？Bry，get her out of here。Take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Move！- Go，go！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,More security here now！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.97,0:10:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Casey！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bernie，stand by，stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.07,0:11:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go，go，go。- Watch your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，take this。The sugar will take the edge off the shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on，drink some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。It's okay。You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Casey。Rambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seriously，Bry，you should think about coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got the edge。There's more of this to be had.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's going to college next year？- Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're gonna lose her。- That gives me a year to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.83,0:11:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Mills，she'd like to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How are you feeling？- Better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,So your daughter wants to be a singer？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep，since she was 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not what everyone thinks it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once the glam wears off，it's just a lot of hotel rooms，lots of airports.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first number is Gio，my vocal coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he says she can sing，she can sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll give her coaching she needs，the fee is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,The second number is my manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Gio clears her，he'll make sure she gets a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you。- No，Mr。Mills，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There she is。- Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi，sweetie。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't look so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just surprised。I thought it was just gonna be Kim and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I asked Mom to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,One raspberry-banana milkshake，extra cherries，just the way you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks。- Lennie… Lenore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Would you like something？- I'm fine，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,So？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.67,0:13:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，Dad，guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know my friend Amanda？- Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her cousins asked us to spend vacation with them in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,How cool is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why do you want to go to Paris？- Dad。Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.89,0:13:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Louvre，the lmpressionist museum，the Picasso Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were so into art.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you kidding？I've been to the MOMA，like，a hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amanda went last summer，she came back，she could practically speak French.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,And because you're under 18…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you need my permission to leave the country？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，please。I really，really wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've got this sick apartment overlooking the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just you and Amanda？- And her cousins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't make a big deal out of this，Bryan。Just sign the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- I'm not comfortable with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad。- I know the world，sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad，please。- A 17-year-old should not travel alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not gonna be alone。- Two 17-year-olds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amanda's 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about this？How about if I go along？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You won't know I'm there。I'm very good at being invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,As you so amply demonstrated for most of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just sign the paper，Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone at this table knows what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Kimmy，there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:14:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't want anything else。- Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't get you。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sacrificed our marriage in the service of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You made a mess of your life in service of your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't you sacrifice a little this time for your daughter？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I would sacrifice anything for her。- What's your problem？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not comfortable putting my daughter at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Putting our daughter at risk by going to Paris？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's coming。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The address and phone number of where you're staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.57,0:15:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You move，I wanna know where and with whom you'll be staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call me when you land。Call me every night before you go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's international。My number is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.37,0:16:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，awesome。- Kimmy，you're not focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I am。- What did I say？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said call you when I land，every night before I go to sleep…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…your phone's international，the number's programmed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，one last thing。I get to take you to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There you go。- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Daddy。Thank you，thank you，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom，he signed it，he signed it。I'm gonna go call Amanda！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.69,0:16:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it have been easier to sign the first time？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it have been easier if you and I had talked about it first？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Certain areas in Paris you should avoid。I've written them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad。- Come on，take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna be spending 90 percent of our time in museums。Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's like telling water not to be wet，sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom says your job made you paranoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，my job made me aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I used to ask Mom what your job was that you were away all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,And she would tell me to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whenever I did see you，I was afraid to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.40,0:17:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Maybe because…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I was afraid to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.49,0:17:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like，maybe it was something I wouldn't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I worked for the government。You knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you were like a spy，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What happens if I push this button？- Don't touch that button.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，no，I was a… I was a preventer，actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A preventer？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you prevent？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bad things from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,So it was a good job？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Yep，it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you miss it？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I missed you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kim！- Dad，there's Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go ahead。I'll get the bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jimmy'll give you a hand with those。- I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lenore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know about this？She's not just going to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.67,0:18:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know。- She lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，because she can't be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your rules and conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's U2's European tour dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's following a rock band around Europe？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,All kids do。Stuart got her tickets，arranged her to stay in the best hotels.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.23,0:19:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Best hotels。You know，you live in your little bubble here…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…behind your wall，with your maids and chauffeurs and servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No idea what the world is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，and neither will she unless she goes out and experiences it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell me I don't know the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,For five years I waited for a phone call that didn't come for weeks at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,For a knock on the door telling me there'd be no calls anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I know you moved here to build some sort of relationship with Kimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you're not gonna do that by smothering her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let her live，or I promise，I promise you'll lose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.65,0:20:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll teach you the French words I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Which may not be that much，but… - Okay。Yeah，right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three。Okay，now take one…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Need some help？One with the two of you？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- He's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Yeah，great。Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you from？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,California.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I'm Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is Kim。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice to meet you。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're going into Paris？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，taxis here are so damned expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.43,0:21:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Want to share？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。Sure。- Okay，perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,To check arrivals，please press one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please enter the flight number.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flight 288 arrived in Paris Charles de Gaulle…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…at 8 a.m。Local time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，are you serious？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.09,0:21:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，my God。- Nice address.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.55,0:21:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my cousins'，but they're in Madrid，so we have the whole place to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,How cool is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I didn't know that。- It's no biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I have to be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice to meet you。- Oh，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You too。- Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is a party tonight at school。Want to come？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sure。Yeah。- We don't even know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.95,0:22:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is there to know？He's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I come pick you up around 9？- Okay，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，great。Your apartment？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.83,0:22:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's the whole fifth floor。Hoffmann。- Okay。See you tonight。Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.89,0:22:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two girls around 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.81,0:22:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How sick is this？- Are you kidding me？It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just wish you would've told me they weren't gonna be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:22:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's the difference？- I told my dad they'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You told your dad you were going to museums too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:22:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on。He's not gonna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.82,0:23:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna sleep with him。- Who？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.74,0:23:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Peter。- You just met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear French guys are amazing in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Maybe he has a friend，huh？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Oh，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta lose it sometime。Might as well be in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.11,0:23:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Amanda，where's the bathroom？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to pee！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.73,0:24:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- It's me。Has Kim called you？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan，she's 17。She's in Paris。Give her some space.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.99,0:24:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'll call。Take a sleeping pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.45,0:24:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have a drink or something。Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.50,0:24:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.52,0:24:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.85,0:24:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did I say？You were supposed to call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.56,0:24:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.77,0:24:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought something was wrong with the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.19,0:24:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。It was such a rush at the airport。- All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.07,0:24:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if I'd had the number where you were staying…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.90,0:24:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I would've just called there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:24:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the number？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.99,0:25:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't have it。- Kimmy，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.75,0:25:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is one of the conditions。Let me talk to the cousins.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.70,0:25:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll get it from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，they're in Spain。I didn't know。I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,To Spain？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.67,0:25:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim，is there anything else you want to tell me？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.56,0:25:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.43,0:25:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There's someone here。- The cousins are back？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.60,0:25:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.15,0:25:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，my God。They got Amanda。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.15,0:25:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？Kimmy？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.48,0:25:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad。- Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kim。- Dad。They took her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.83,0:25:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They took her。- All right，listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.29,0:25:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did you meet anyone on the plane？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.70,0:25:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- In the airport？- No。Yes，Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Peter？Peter who？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.75,0:25:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- An American？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.09,0:25:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did he know where you were staying？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.30,0:26:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He took a cab with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.39,0:26:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.01,0:26:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Please，I'm scared。- I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.85,0:26:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay focused，Kimmy。You have to hold it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.40,0:26:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many people are there？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.11,0:26:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Three，four。I don't know。- Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.23,0:26:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm in the bathroom。- Go to the next bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.86,0:26:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get under the bed。Tell me when you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.04,0:26:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm here。- Now，the next part is very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.71,0:26:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are going to take you。Kim，stay focused，baby。This is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.76,0:26:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will have five，maybe ten seconds。Very important seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.43,0:26:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave the phone on the floor。Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.10,0:26:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shout out everything you see about them。Hair color，eye color，tall，short，scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.31,0:26:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything you see。You understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.44,0:27:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're there。I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember，concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put the phone closer so I can hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.20,0:27:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're leaving。I think they're…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beard。Six feet。Tattoo right hand，moon and star.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.60,0:28:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.60,0:28:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.86,0:28:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you are looking for a ransom，I can tell you，I don't have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.95,0:28:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what I do have are a very particular set of skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.53,0:28:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Skills I've acquired over a very long career.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Skills that make me a nightmare for people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.96,0:28:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you let my daughter go now，that'll be the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.47,0:28:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will not look for you。I will not pursue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.51,0:28:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if you don't，I will look for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.47,0:28:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will find you…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.39,0:28:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.56,0:29:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.75,0:29:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam，it's me。I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.08,0:29:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna download something。I need it analyzed。Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.91,0:29:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's been taken。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.70,0:29:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Any enemies overseas？- Why would I have enemies？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.21,0:29:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do business overseas through multiple shell corporations.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.30,0:29:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were involved in an oil deal with a bunch of Russians that went south.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.09,0:29:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How do you know that？- I was not gonna let my daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.06,0:29:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…live with someone without knowing everything about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.06,0:29:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I have a few resources… - Now is not the time for dick measuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.39,0:29:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Anyone looking to hurt you？- Not that I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.73,0:29:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Which room's Kim's？- What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a call from her。There were people in the apartment。She was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.53,0:29:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，God。- Which one？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.07,0:29:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.91,0:29:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there something I should be doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.87,0:29:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a lease agreement with NetJet through your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.95,0:30:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.00,0:30:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get me a plane to Paris。- For when？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.05,0:30:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,An hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.34,0:30:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna make the call。You all right？- Yeah，yeah。I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.47,0:30:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you please get her back to me，Bryan？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,First I have to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.11,0:30:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam，what have you got？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.86,0:30:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're speaking Albanian.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.27,0:30:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Based on their accents and dialects，they must be from Tropoja.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.87,0:30:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The place is ground zero for scummers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.87,0:30:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even the Russians give these guys a wide berth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.74,0:30:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one you spoke to，his name is Marko.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.25,0:30:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have information that a mobster boss…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.42,0:30:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…by the name of Marko Hoxha moved to Paris about six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.79,0:30:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he's the one，he's a big fish。The tattoo，by the way，is a group ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.72,0:30:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Am I on speaker or are you by yourself？- Lenore is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.14,0:31:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Lennie。- Hello，Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.26,0:31:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,She needs to hear it，Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.56,0:31:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,The specialty of the groups coming out of this area is trafficking in women.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.23,0:31:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Keep going。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.57,0:31:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their previous m.o。Was to offer women from emerging East European countries…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.53,0:31:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…like Yugoslavia，Romania，Bulgaria，jobs in the West as maids and nannies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.75,0:31:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once smuggled in，they'd addict them to drugs and turn them into prostitutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.67,0:31:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lately，however，they've decided that it's more economical…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.75,0:31:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…just to kidnap traveling young women。Saves on transportation costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.80,0:31:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.39,0:31:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,What else？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.14,0:31:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Based on the way these groups operate，our analyst says…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you have a 96-hour window from the time she was grabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.40,0:31:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- To what？- To never finding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.02,0:31:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.28,0:31:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.66,0:31:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mustache。Six feet。Tattoo on right hand，moon and star.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.57,0:32:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Da…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.04,0:32:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.93,0:32:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.34,0:32:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.47,0:32:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.65,0:34:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.66,0:34:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，they got Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.46,0:34:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.25,0:34:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，they got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.35,0:34:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,They took her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.68,0:34:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go to the next bedroom。Get under the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tell me when you're there。- I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.57,0:34:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay focused，baby。Leave the phone on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.61,0:34:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Concentrate。Shout out everything you see about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.28,0:34:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hair color，eye color，tall，short，scars。Anything you see。You understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.33,0:34:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're there。I can hear them。Remember，concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.55,0:35:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're leaving。Daddy！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.30,0:35:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.55,0:35:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beard。Six feet。Tattoo right hand，moon and star.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.19,0:35:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.58,0:36:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.87,0:37:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm Peter。- I'm Ingrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.66,0:37:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- On holidays？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.13,0:37:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Me too。- Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.01,0:37:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cabs here are so damned expensive。Want to share？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.63,0:37:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sure。Why not？- Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.09,0:37:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Excuse me。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.85,0:37:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.64,0:37:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The two American girls from yesterday？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.03,0:37:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,The next rib drives into your lungs。The two American girls，where are they？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.94,0:39:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just like the old days。- Would you have it any other way？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.07,0:39:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Between you and me？No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.70,0:39:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,But now that I sit behind a desk，the world looks different.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You mean，looks boring。- I mean different.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.03,0:39:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，a little boring。But is being retired any more interesting？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.21,0:39:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,It wasn't。Until my daughter disappeared in Paris yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.75,0:39:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,She and her friend were marked by a spotter at the airport。Albanians took her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.89,0:39:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How do you know this？- I'm retired，not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.72,0:39:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I assume you don't want to go to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:40:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was told I have 96 hours。That was 16 hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.22,0:40:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，first，we should find the spotter。- I found him，he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.10,0:40:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You found him that way？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan，you cannot just run around tearing down Paris…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.16,0:40:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tear down the Eiffel Tower if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.49,0:40:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't forget who you talk to。- I'm talking to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.32,0:40:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are。But please remember，your friend has a desk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.58,0:40:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Deputy director，Internal Security.」 Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.25,0:40:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Albanians？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.46,0:40:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,They showed up from the East，six，seven years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.47,0:40:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifteen，20 of them。Now there are hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.01,0:40:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't even know how many。And dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I heard。Where do I find them？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.81,0:40:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,The best place to start is Porte de Clichy。Bryan，try not to make a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.67,0:41:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Gregor Milocivic？- Yes。Yes，I am Gregor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.17,0:41:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Mr。Smith。Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.31,0:42:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here is my resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.77,0:42:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,The employment agency said we would be doing translations.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.72,0:42:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Albanian to English。You do speak Albanian？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.85,0:42:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Albanian，Serbian，Croatian。I was a teacher in primary school…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.15,0:42:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …before the war began in Pristina… - What's your rate？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.07,0:42:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,My rate？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.53,0:42:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is 25 per hour for the first three hours and then it goes up…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.86,0:42:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Now，here's for 10 hours。Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.79,0:42:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Smith，I do not understand。What is the job exactly？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.45,0:42:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now the job is to wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.84,0:42:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.42,0:42:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。Looking for a date？- I love your dress。Is that silk？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。You want to know the prices？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.06,0:42:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just the way it falls，it must be silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.10,0:42:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,How it compliments the natural curves of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.61,0:42:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rate is 40 euros for the standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.86,0:42:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Standard？Could you be more specific？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.82,0:43:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back home，the standard covers a range of possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.65,0:43:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like kissing，you know，closed lips，open lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.20,0:43:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lf you're not buying，piss off。- I didn't say I wasn't buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.37,0:43:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like to get comfortable before I purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.66,0:43:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like this karaoke machine I bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.70,0:43:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must have read that manual from cover to cover so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.54,0:43:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't give a shit。You're gonna get me in trouble if you don't buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.17,0:43:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Trouble？Really？With who？- Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.54,0:43:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay。Listen，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.39,0:43:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I want a package deal，do I get a discount？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.18,0:43:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You cost me two now。- My name's Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.60,0:43:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，God。You better leave。- I thought we were negotiating.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.44,0:43:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anton，I swear，it's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.31,0:43:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I told him… - Why are you bothering the girl？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.31,0:43:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- None of your business。- She is my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.82,0:43:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if you're not spending money，you're costing money.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.62,0:43:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I was negotiating。- No negotiating。Price is the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.57,0:43:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you owe me for two that got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.66,0:43:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't owe you nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.42,0:43:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fifty euros or I kick your ass。- Sure，sure，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.75,0:43:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Here's your 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.18,0:44:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And another 50 for being an asshole。Now get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.39,0:44:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I see you again，I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.06,0:44:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Smith，I do not know what kind of job I'm supposed to do for you，but…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.03,0:44:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You are to translate。- Yes。But translate what？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.16,0:44:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.29,0:44:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.50,0:44:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're talking about you。- What about me？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.54,0:44:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're not saying nice things。- Be specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.38,0:44:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're saying… Excuse me，Mr。Smith。- What an asshole you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.47,0:44:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，if you can explain to me why we're doing this…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.26,0:44:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.14,0:44:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of them says，the sausage gave him heartburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.10,0:44:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.48,0:45:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other one is suggesting something his grandmother used to give him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.10,0:45:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you really want to hear all this？- Every word.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.74,0:45:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now they're talking about football。The game between Lazio and Marseille.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.95,0:45:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they lost money on the betting.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.04,0:45:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Perhaps if I knew the purpose… - You're better off not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.75,0:45:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it still football？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.21,0:45:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,One is on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.34,0:45:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has to do a job at the construction site.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.80,0:45:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something about fresh merchandise giving problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.01,0:45:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Smith，I do not understand any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.55,0:45:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to。Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.68,0:45:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I asked for an English-Albanian dictionary，did you bring one？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.93,0:45:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.16,0:47:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.93,0:47:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where did you get this？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.22,0:47:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where did you get this？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.51,0:47:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm good。- Who gave this to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.73,0:47:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who… Who gave this to you？- I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.36,0:47:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.89,0:48:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.03,0:48:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.38,0:52:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Monsieur Allen，how are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.25,0:52:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Gilles。How's the wife？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.29,0:52:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，still in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.00,0:52:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Been a long time since I've seen you。- Way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.34,0:52:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The usual accommodation？- Plus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.20,0:54:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.41,0:54:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We need to talk。- I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.20,0:54:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，can't you come and meet me first？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.29,0:54:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't see you。Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.21,0:54:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can see you and hear you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.71,0:54:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can tell them to stop jogging now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.31,0:54:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't think I was gonna come down，did you？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.68,0:54:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't think you were gonna make such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.14,0:54:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't have time to worry about neatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.36,0:54:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know。You have 70 hours。- Now I have 56.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.19,0:54:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，now you have none.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.03,0:54:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,My chief wanted to arrest you，I convinced him to send you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.08,0:54:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Air France 001 leaves today at 2。First class.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.08,0:55:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Courtesy of the French government for past services rendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.38,0:55:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And what about my daughter？- I told you，I sit behind a desk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.00,0:55:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I take my orders from someone who sits behind a bigger desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.56,0:55:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，seven dead bodies，three in hospital，a building destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.39,0:55:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Total chaos at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.89,0:55:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wanted your ass in chains。It's the best I could do，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.39,0:55:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry doesn't cut it，Jean-Claude。Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.69,0:55:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't beat the state，Bryan。You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.32,0:55:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to。I'm trying to save my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.95,0:55:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a trailer，not a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.99,0:56:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.32,0:56:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，it's fluids.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.28,0:56:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,And medication to counteract the drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.08,0:56:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.46,0:56:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where'd you get this？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.29,0:56:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where did you get this jacket？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.67,0:56:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you get it from her？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.47,0:56:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was it from this girl？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.76,0:56:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.59,0:56:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I was cold，she gave it to me。- Where？Where did she give it to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.94,0:56:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- In the house。- What house？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.60,0:56:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,The house with the red door.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.28,0:56:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.66,0:57:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said it was a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.96,0:57:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,The girl who gave you this，was she in the house？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.54,0:57:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.34,0:57:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.84,0:57:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.48,0:57:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to find this house。Do you know where it is？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.99,0:57:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.16,0:57:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good morning。- May I help you？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.00,0:57:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm here to see your boss。- No boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.67,0:58:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're doing nothing wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.18,0:58:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,One button，and 30 agents will be here…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.27,0:58:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…before you have time to scratch your balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.77,0:58:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop jerking around before I close you down for wasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.78,0:58:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.04,0:58:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have weapon？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.62,0:58:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're holding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.23,0:59:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Black，one sugar，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.95,0:59:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it you want？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.63,0:59:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here to negotiate the rates.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.42,0:59:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,We already negotiated the rate with Mr。Macon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.84,0:59:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Macon has moved to another division.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.17,0:59:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here for the renegotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.85,0:59:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless you think I'm being unreasonable，let me explain ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.26,0:59:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice coffee。We have you under satellite surveillance，24 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.69,0:59:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,We hear everything you say，we know everything you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.48,0:59:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what it costs just to change the angle…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.99,0:59:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of the lens on a satellite orbiting 200 miles above the Earth？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.83,0:59:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And those costs have gone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.37,0:59:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our costs go up，your costs go up。It's only logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.54,0:59:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the way，which one of you is Marko？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.04,0:59:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you want to know？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.04,0:59:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was told Marko is in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.75,1:00:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are all Marko.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.50,1:00:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marko from Tropoja.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.30,1:00:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are all from Tropoja.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.35,1:00:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that's the game you want to play，the rate just went up 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.85,1:00:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you are trying to extort us because we are immigrants，we know the law.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm extorting you because you are breaking the law.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.15,1:00:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which charge would you like to be arrested for？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.81,1:00:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drugs，kidnapping，prostitution？Take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.03,1:00:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You come to this country，take advantage of it…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.78,1:00:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and think because we are tolerant，we are weak and helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.24,1:00:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your arrogance offends me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.07,1:00:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,For that，the rate went up 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.25,1:00:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，do you want to get down to business or to keep playing？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.29,1:00:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How much？- Twenty percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.30,1:00:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you have my word it'll not go up for a year.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.06,1:00:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you say 「sugar」 in your language？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.53,1:01:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've made a very good investment，gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.96,1:01:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you in a month.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.04,1:01:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,A friend gave this to me。It's Albanian。You mind translating it？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.56,1:01:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.64,1:01:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good luck。- Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.56,1:01:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good luck。Good luck。- Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.24,1:01:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't remember me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.75,1:01:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We spoke on the phone two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.29,1:02:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you I would find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.73,1:03:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.16,1:03:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.70,1:03:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wake up！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.28,1:04:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to be focused.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.21,1:04:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you focused yet？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.93,1:04:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is this girl？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.72,1:04:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is she？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.00,1:04:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，we used to outsource this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.00,1:04:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what we found was the countries we outsourced to…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.80,1:04:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…had unreliable power grids。Very Third World.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.34,1:05:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd turn on a switch，power wouldn't come on…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.84,1:05:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and then tempers would get short。People would resort to pulling fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.06,1:05:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Acid drips on bare skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.56,1:05:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The whole exercise would become counterproductive.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.15,1:05:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,But here，the power's stable.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.98,1:05:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，there's a nice even flow.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.49,1:05:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，you can flip a switch and the power stays on all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.86,1:05:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is she？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.14,1:05:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I don't have any more time to waste，Marko from Tropoja.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.56,1:05:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me what I need or this switch'll stay on…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.02,1:05:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…till they turn power off for lack of payment on the bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.24,1:05:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is my daughter？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.07,1:06:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't keep virgins，we sell them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.74,1:06:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was virgin，lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.08,1:06:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sold my daughter？You sold her？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.25,1:06:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,To who？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.58,1:06:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.67,1:06:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Saint-Clair.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.05,1:06:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Saint-Clair.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.51,1:06:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Saint-Clair？Saint-Clair。Is that a person，a place？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.67,1:06:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Person。Patrice Saint-Clair.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.89,1:06:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Patrice Saint-Clair.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.10,1:06:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where can I find him？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.39,1:06:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.02,1:06:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。I don't know。I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.94,1:06:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！I don't know！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.36,1:06:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know！No！Please！Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.53,1:06:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.54,1:06:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not that。Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.79,1:06:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.04,1:06:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's not gonna save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.48,1:07:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look who dropped by.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.15,1:07:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan，what a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.94,1:07:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean-Claude.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.15,1:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,The children waited up for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.79,1:07:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you tuck them in，maybe we can eat before everything gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.29,1:07:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan，will you do the honors？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.99,1:07:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sure。- I'll be just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.44,1:08:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just telling Bryan how nice it's been…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.78,1:08:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…since you left the old job for the new one.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.12,1:08:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Home every night for dinner，get to see the kids more.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.12,1:08:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，must be nice coming home every night，seeing your kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.38,1:08:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan has been thinking about relocating.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.88,1:08:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.54,1:08:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,To Paris，he's been visiting houses.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.50,1:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- White or dark meat？- Dark，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.34,1:08:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find anything interesting？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.85,1:08:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact，I did，in the 10th arrondissement on Rue Paradis.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.55,1:08:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,People there know someone that works in your office.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.26,1:08:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Mr。Macon。Do you know him？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.40,1:08:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Henry。I call him Mr。Nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.86,1:08:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always seems like he's about to have a problem。Carrots？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.73,1:08:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got to the bottom of it，Jean-Claude.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.90,1:08:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.78,1:08:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope you're not involved in this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.41,1:08:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What shit？- This is not the time or place，Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.41,1:08:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you involved？- Involved in what？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.17,1:08:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you two talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.83,1:08:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you？- My salary is X，my expenses are Y.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.58,1:09:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as my family is provided for…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.83,1:09:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I do not care where the difference comes from.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.59,1:09:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is my entire involvement.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.68,1:09:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about my family？- I told you…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.84,1:09:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I would help as long as it didn't cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.43,1:09:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is Patrice Saint-Clair？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.93,1:09:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，I don't care。I am driving you to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.69,1:09:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean-Claude.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.40,1:09:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get going。Dinner is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.23,1:09:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not finished yet。- Yes，you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.27,1:09:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No！- No，I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.86,1:09:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what happens when you sit behind a desk。You forget things.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.29,1:09:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like the weight in the hand of a gun that's loaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.83,1:09:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isabelle！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.42,1:09:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a flesh wound.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.75,1:09:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if you don't get me what I need，the last thing you'll see…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.63,1:09:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is the bullet I put between her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.80,1:09:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Patrice Saint-Clair.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.48,1:10:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You could've made this less painful…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.45,1:10:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if you had been more concerned about my daughter and less about your desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.74,1:10:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please apologize to your wife for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.35,1:11:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can I help you？- Yes，I'm here to see Mr。Saint-Clair.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.39,1:11:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your name，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.94,1:11:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，your name is not on the list.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.03,1:11:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，please check again.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.65,1:11:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.99,1:12:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I help you，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.88,1:12:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your champagne。- Yeah，I will take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.14,1:12:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have 50，000。Fifty thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.23,1:12:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifty thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.81,1:12:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,One hundred，100，000.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.91,1:12:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,One hundred，150.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.16,1:13:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have 150.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.99,1:13:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your champagne，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.92,1:13:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two，I have two，250.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.79,1:13:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I serve？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.00,1:13:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Please。- I have 250.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.17,1:13:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two-fifty.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.50,1:13:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sold for 250，000.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.79,1:13:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,The last item.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.11,1:13:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,As usual，we save the best for last.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.95,1:13:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speaks English，some French.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.28,1:13:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Certified pure.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.67,1:13:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sorry。- Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.30,1:13:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bidding will begin at 100，000.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.51,1:14:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,One hundred.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.57,1:14:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,One hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.57,1:14:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I said… - I heard what you said.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.90,1:14:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buy her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.40,1:14:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have 100.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.24,1:14:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Buy her。- One-fifty.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.21,1:14:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two hundred.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.50,1:14:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two-fifty，three，350.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.37,1:14:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three hundred and fifty thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.22,1:14:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four。Four.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.92,1:14:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four-fifty，450.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.63,1:14:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four hundred and fifty thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.22,1:14:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four-fifty.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.43,1:14:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Five hundred。Five hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.60,1:14:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Five hundred thousand。Sold.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.06,1:14:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,That concludes the sales for tonight。Thank you all for coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.24,1:14:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You can collect your purchases directly。- Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.36,1:15:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You will never get away with this。- Lf you wanna live，you'll make sure I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.20,1:15:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Mr？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.88,1:15:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we know you're not this man。So，what do we call you？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.64,1:15:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what we call you…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.72,1:15:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…what does matter is what you're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.57,1:15:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,The last girl，I'm her father.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.07,1:15:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，my。- Give her to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.48,1:15:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish I could，honestly.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.95,1:15:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，I'm a father myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.83,1:15:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have two sons and a daughter…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.99,1:15:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but let me tell you something，Mr。Whoever-You-Are.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.20,1:15:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a business.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.71,1:15:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a very unique business…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.63,1:15:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …with a very unique clientele。- I'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.59,1:16:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,In this business，you have no refunds，returns…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.21,1:16:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…discounts，buybacks。All sales are final.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.47,1:16:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides discretion，it's about the only rule we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.26,1:16:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill him。Quietly。I have guests.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.99,1:17:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you please go see which part of 「quietly」…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.54,1:17:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …they did not understand？- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.44,1:17:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，we can resolve this。I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.35,1:17:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should talk，okay？We can work this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.32,1:17:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have no idea…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.11,1:17:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where is she？- Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.57,1:17:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Understand。Please try…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.54,1:17:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a boat by the quay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.83,1:18:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.46,1:18:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was all business，it wasn't personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.05,1:18:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was all personal to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.85,1:25:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.86,1:25:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Daddy。- Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.36,1:25:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You came for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.03,1:25:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You came for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.28,1:25:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you I would.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.31,1:26:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I have your attention。If you're waiting for oversized bags…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.95,1:26:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.57,1:26:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.96,1:26:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.92,1:26:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，here，let me get that for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.42,1:26:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan，if there's anything you need…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.71,1:26:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got everything I need.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.05,1:26:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.80,1:26:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.80,1:26:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.06,1:26:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention，travelers。You are not required to…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.15,1:26:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shall we go？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.11,1:26:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure you don't wanna ride with us？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.25,1:27:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll be fine。I'll take a cab。Thanks。- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.17,1:27:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I love you，Dad。- Love you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.49,1:27:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are we？- I told you。It's a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.45,1:27:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.33,1:27:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,When someone says 「hi，」 it's usually polite to say 「hi」 back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.55,1:27:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.84,1:27:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard you wanna be a singer.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.46,1:27:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I do。- She does.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.85,1:27:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，come on in。Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.91,0:00:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:35.25,Title,0,0,0,0,,《飓风营救》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.43,0:01:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 米尔斯先生 你好吗？ - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢？ - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜你还想再看一遍？ - 你不介意的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.77,0:01:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道放在哪里 - 哦 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你每次来看机子我都收你一元…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.73,0:01:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都够你买一台了 内行都用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽亚·凯莉 碧昂丝 格温·史蒂芬尼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？碧昂丝是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑呢 我要了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 先生 家长聚会在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是金姆的父亲 - 不好意思 我就是为她父亲工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.99,0:02:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是她的亲生父亲 - 没事 西里尔 我来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 布莱恩 - 丽诺尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来给金姆礼物的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有专门给孩子们放礼物的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就跟其他人的放一起吧 - 我想亲手交给她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 仍是我行我素啊 - 哦 拜托 莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.93,0:03:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫你不要这么叫了 - 抱歉 丽诺尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸！ - 哦 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 你好 我的宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 生日快乐 - 我在跟你爸爸说…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …我们如何放置礼物的 - 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拆了这个礼物 而不拆其他的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …可不是个好习惯 - 来 打开它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好酷哦 - 卡拉OK机？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我记得她想成为一个歌星 - 那是12岁的事了 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都变了 - 谢谢 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢就好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还是想当歌手 不要告诉妈妈 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 照张相作个纪念
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有职业摄影师 - 笑一笑 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是我的乖女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 哦 天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪！哦 天哪！哦 天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天…斯图尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特 我爱你！我爱你！我爱你！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 斯图尔特 太意外了 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 布莱恩 - 斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不再是个小女孩了 是吧？ - 我想是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留下来吃午饭吧？ - 不了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来这祝她生日快乐的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 布莱恩 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生日快乐 金姆）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（金姆 17岁）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:05:00.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（金姆 16岁）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都打电话提醒你了 五月的第三个星期六 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 牛排 红酒？很熟悉吧？ - 也许他脑子里塞了太多事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 退休工人的忙碌生活 每天都是个新冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过退休了都做些什么？ 睡睡觉？打打高尔夫？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搭讪富孀？ - 一上午有的忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 伙计们 你们知道我在这的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我们今天给她庆生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们相信我的金姆都17岁了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,17岁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了金姆 - 莉妮还恨你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:06:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不再是莉妮了 她叫丽诺尔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 她还恨你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她丈夫呢？ - 还是老样子 很配
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是追根究底总会发现点什么 - 想要我们帮你查尽管说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你觉得他没查过？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 伯尼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金姆怎么样？ - 很好 她很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.53,0:06:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？她还是没回来住？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了和她亲近 你放弃了自己的生活…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…对此她有谢过你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么生活 哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 还记得头儿失踪后 我们在贝鲁特的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱和那个疯狂的真主党酋长耗上了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙扬言要把我们都弄进去 然后自己就失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了性命 我们可是狼狈地逃出那鬼地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…那时你在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应过绝不会错过她的生日
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.85,0:06:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 当他们发觉你悄然离开…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑去9公里外参加你女儿的生日派对…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…兰格利（CIA总部）那边也没怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时说你的下个目的地是哪来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去北极观察企鹅 我想是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 企鹅在南极
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 是在阿拉斯加 你到底想说什么 萨姆？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 只要你一句话 我们随时欢迎你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要半熟的牛排？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 - 再见 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 伙计们 - 拜拜 布莱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 听着 听着 听着 不开玩笑…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…花时间陪金姆 弥补以前的空白是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但明天的工作呢？就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作四小时 2500元报酬…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…只是护送某个女歌星来回演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还缺一个人 - 歌星？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚她是否算得上歌手 她更像棵摇钱树
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱片销量达到两千万张 却还不到25岁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作很容易
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,送她去那 再送回来 里面由他们自己人负责
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好的 好的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 答应了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 就像以前一样 - 比以前更好 不会有人丧命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天见 晚安 伙计们 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐后面去 温迪 - 我老是坐后面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 不好意思 请继续往前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我妈才叫夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 时间到了 走吧 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼 凯西 你们守在这 布莱 你进去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 走吧 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢光临
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.69,0:09:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔斯 布莱恩·米尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 布莱恩·米尔斯 - 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该你了 快 我们走吧 - 好的 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个女儿想成为一个歌手 我想问问你有没有什么建议
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她别走这条路
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到有次我们在等空袭…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们等啊等 然后我的卫星电话响了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪位？ - 喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要干掉的那家伙 - 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他想知道我们是否要喝点茶 - 抱歉 各位 是金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,噪音？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在演唱会现场呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这首歌？是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是她 不 不 不 我不是来看演唱会的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我不是来看的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮朋友做些保安工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然我见到她了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为谁在保护她啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到你这么有兴趣 我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 很高兴接到你的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能打给我 我很开心 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,午餐？明天？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 没问题 我知道那地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二点半
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他来了 然后呢？ - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她要和我一起吃午饭 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就我们俩 - 不错 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没？有进展 棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把门打开了？ 布莱 带她离开这 你领路
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧！ - 走 走！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来些保安！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.97,0:10:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼 准备行动 准备行动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.07,0:11:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 走 快走 - 小心头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 喝点 糖水可以压惊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 来 再喝点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没事了 你安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西 兰博
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真点 布莱 你该考虑下加入我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已尝到甜头了 你还可以拿到更多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她明年要上大学了吧？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就要失去她了 - 一年够我找回她了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.83,0:11:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔斯先生 她想要见你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好点了吗？ - 好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女儿想当歌手？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 从她5岁起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌手的生活并不如其他人所想的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦没了新鲜感 就只剩下酒店和机场的东奔西跑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要的就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个号码是我的声乐老师吉奥的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他说行 就代表她能唱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会给她必要的指导 学费我来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二个号码是我经纪人的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果吉奥肯定了她 他就能为她创造机会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不 米尔斯先生 是我要谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她来了 - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 宝贝 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要那么激动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是很惊讶 我以为就我和金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫妈妈来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份覆盆子香蕉奶昔加樱桃 你最喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 莉妮…丽诺尔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要点什么？ - 不了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.67,0:13:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你猜怎么着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我朋友阿曼达吧？ - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的表姐妹邀请我们一起去巴黎度假
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么想去巴黎了？ - 爸爸 不会吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.89,0:13:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗浮宫 印象派博物馆 毕加索博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你会对艺术这么感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的？ 我都去过现代艺术博物馆一百多次了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达去年夏天去的 回来后她都能说法语了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你还未满18岁…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…所以你要得到我的允许才能出国？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 求你了 我真的真的很想去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们的公寓超棒的 可以俯瞰塞纳河
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就你和阿曼达？ - 还有她的表姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别小题大作了 布莱恩 签字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 我不放心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 我了解这个世界 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 求你了 - 一个17岁的姑娘不该单独出行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是一个人啊 - 两个17岁的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达19岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样如何？我和你们一起去？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会看到我的 我很擅长做隐形人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能少操点心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,签字吧 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要想想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道那表示什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 金姆 有件好事告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:14:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想听 - 金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真搞不懂你 - 怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了国家你牺牲了我们的婚姻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了国家你把自己的生活搞得一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你就不能为你女儿牺牲一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我愿意为她牺牲一切 - 那到底是什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不放心让女儿去冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,去巴黎就是让女儿去冒险？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她来了 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住的地址和电话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.57,0:15:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,和谁出门 出门去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了给我打电话 每晚睡前给我打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是全球漫游的 我的号码在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.37,0:16:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 真啰嗦 - 金姆 你没在听
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在听呀 - 我都说了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说到了给你打电话 每晚睡前给你打电话…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你的手机是全球漫游的 你的号码就存在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 最后一件事 我送你去机场
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿去吧 - 耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 爸爸 谢谢 谢谢 太谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 他签了 他签了 我要去给阿曼达打电话！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.69,0:16:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始就签了不就好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我先谈下不更好？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巴黎要注意的地方我都写下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 来 拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分时间我们都会在博物馆 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像说沾水不会弄湿一样 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈说你的工作让你神经质
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的工作使我警觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前总是问妈妈你是做什么的 为什么你老不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她让我自己问你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次看到你 我都不敢问
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.40,0:17:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？为什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 也许是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我害怕发现
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.49,0:17:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是些我不喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为政府工作 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一个间谍 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果我按下这个按钮会怎么样？ - 别碰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 不 事实上 我是… 我是负责防护工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 防护？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,防止坏事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个好工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怀念它吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更想念你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金姆！ - 爸爸 是阿曼达
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 我来拿包
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.57,0:18:29.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欧洲地图）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:30.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴黎、伦敦、罗马） （柏林、马德里）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉米会帮你拿的 - 我自己能行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽诺尔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？她不仅仅去巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.67,0:18:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 她对我撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 因为她没法对你说实情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老说规矩啊条件啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,U2的欧洲巡演日程
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要跟随一个摇滚乐队环游欧洲？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们都这样 斯图尔特帮她搞到了票 为她安排了最好的酒店
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.23,0:19:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的酒店 知道吗 你住在自己的小圈子里…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…有仆人和司机供差遣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不知道外面的真实世界
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可她也不知道 所以才要出去体验一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要说我不懂这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年来我一直在等你的电话 你总是好几周都不打回来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是担心会有人敲门 告诉我你已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你搬来这 是为了重建你和金姆的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能这样管着她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她去吧 否则我肯定 我肯定你会失去她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.65,0:20:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会教你法语
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会的也不多 但是… - 好的 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 好了 照张…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要帮忙吗？帮你们俩合影？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 他长得真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 不错 很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从哪来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:21:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望她们都是加州女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish they were all California girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫彼得
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是金姆 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去巴黎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道 这的出租车贵的要死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.43,0:21:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起搭车如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 当然可以 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,查询航班抵达 请按1
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请输入航班
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,288号航班在当地时间上午8点…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…抵达巴黎戴高乐机场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不是真的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.09,0:21:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 我的天 - 这地方真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.55,0:21:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是啊 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我表亲的 不过他们还在马德里 所以这整个地方就是我们的了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我都不知道 - 又没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴认识你们 - 哦 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们也很高兴认识你 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚学校有个派对 来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 我们跟他不熟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.95,0:22:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有什么关系？他很帅
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我9点来接你们？ - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你们的公寓是？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.83,0:22:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 整个五楼都是 姓霍夫曼 - 好的 晚上见 拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,五楼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.89,0:22:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个18岁左右的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.81,0:22:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完蛋了？ - 你没搞错吧？这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该告诉我他们不在这
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:22:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么关系？ - 我跟我爸爸说他们在的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还跟你爸说你会去博物馆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:22:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 得了 他不会知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.82,0:23:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要和他上床 - 谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.74,0:23:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得 - 你才认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说法国人床上功夫都很好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许他带了个朋友 哈？ - 不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 哦 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早会有第一次 还不如在巴黎呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.11,0:23:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿曼达 洗手间在哪？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要上厕所！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.73,0:24:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？ - 是我 金姆给你打电话了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 她17岁了 她在巴黎 给她点空间
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.99,0:24:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会打给你的 吃片安眠药
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.45,0:24:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点酒什么的 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.50,0:24:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.52,0:24:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.85,0:24:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么说的？你该打电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.56,0:24:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.77,0:24:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为手机坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.19,0:24:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 在机场太忙了 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.07,0:24:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我有你那边的号码…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.90,0:24:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我就直接打到那了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:24:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的电话是多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.99,0:25:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还不知道 - 金姆 说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.75,0:25:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是条件之一 让我跟表亲她们讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.70,0:25:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会问她们的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 她们在西班牙 我不知道 我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,西班牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.67,0:25:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 还有什么没告诉我的？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.56,0:25:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.43,0:25:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人来了 - 表亲她们回来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.60,0:25:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.15,0:25:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪 他们抓了阿曼达 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.15,0:25:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？金姆？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.48,0:25:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金姆 - 爸爸 他们抓了她
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.83,0:25:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们抓住了她 - 好的 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.29,0:25:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 飞机上你们有遇到谁吗？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.70,0:25:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 机场呢？ - 没有 不 彼得
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得？他姓什么？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.75,0:25:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美国人？ - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.09,0:25:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你们住哪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.30,0:26:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我们一起搭的出租车
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.39,0:26:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 他们要过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.01,0:26:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救救我 我好怕 - 我知道你害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.85,0:26:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中注意力 金姆 你要冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.40,0:26:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.11,0:26:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三个 四个 我不确定 - 你的位置在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.23,0:26:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在洗手间 - 到隔壁的卧室去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.86,0:26:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在床底下 躲好了告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.04,0:26:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 接下来非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.71,0:26:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会把你抓走 金姆 你要集中注意力 宝贝 这是关键
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.76,0:26:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有5到10秒的时间 这几秒钟很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.43,0:26:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电话放在地上 集中注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.10,0:26:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你看到的都说出来 发色 瞳色 身高 疤痕等等
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.31,0:26:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到的一切 明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.44,0:27:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了 我能听见
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 全神贯注
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.43,0:27:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科 你确定有两个女生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marco, are you sure there are two girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电话放近点 我才听得到
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.18,0:27:35.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（法语）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.20,0:27:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了 我觉得他们…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.30,0:27:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.50,0:27:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有胡子 六英尺高 右手有月亮和星星的纹身
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.60,0:28:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.60,0:28:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.86,0:28:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们要赎金 我可以告诉你们 我没钱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.95,0:28:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我还是有些特别的手段的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.53,0:28:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我在漫长的职业生涯中学到的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这正是像你们这样的人的噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.96,0:28:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们放过我女儿 那么这件事到此结束
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.47,0:28:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会去找你们 也不会追查你们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.51,0:28:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不就此罢手 我会找到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.47,0:28:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.39,0:28:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…然后杀了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.56,0:29:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.75,0:29:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 是我 我需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.08,0:29:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下载了些东西 帮我分析下 马上
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.91,0:29:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她被抓了 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.70,0:29:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 国外的仇人？ - 为什么我会有仇人？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.21,0:29:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在海外利用多家空壳公司做生意
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.30,0:29:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和一伙俄罗斯人的石油生意 越来越糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.09,0:29:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的？ - 我不会让我的女儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.06,0:29:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…和不知底细的人住一起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.06,0:29:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也有不少可靠消息… - 现在不是玩侦探的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.39,0:29:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人要伤害你？ - 就我所知没有
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.73,0:29:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个房间是金姆的？ - 发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接到她的电话 有人在公寓里 她被抓了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.53,0:29:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪 - 哪个房间？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.07,0:29:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那间
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.91,0:29:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做点什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.87,0:29:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的公司和NetJet航空公司有租约吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.95,0:30:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.00,0:30:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我弄架去巴黎的飞机 - 什么时候要？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.05,0:30:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,越快越好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.34,0:30:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要打个电话 你还好吧？ - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.47,0:30:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你把她带回来好吗 布莱恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我得找到她
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.11,0:30:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 有什么发现？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.86,0:30:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说阿尔巴尼亚语
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.27,0:30:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,从语音语调来看 他们一定来自卓帕加
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.87,0:30:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方是人渣们的巢穴
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.87,0:30:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连俄罗斯人都对这些家伙敬而远之
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.74,0:30:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你讲话的那个叫马科
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.25,0:30:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到消息…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.42,0:30:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一个叫马科·霍查的黑道老大 六个月前搬去了巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.79,0:30:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果就是他 那就是条大鱼 另外那个纹身是帮派的标识
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.72,0:30:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我开了免提还是不止你一个人在听？ - 丽诺尔在这
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.14,0:31:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 莉妮 - 你好 萨姆
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.26,0:31:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也想听 萨姆
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.56,0:31:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那块地方的帮派专门拐卖女人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.23,0:31:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.57,0:31:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们之前的惯用伎俩就是向 新兴东欧国家的女人…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.53,0:31:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…像南斯拉夫 罗马尼亚 保加利亚这些国家 提供在西方做女佣和保姆的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.75,0:31:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦偷渡过来 就让她们染上毒瘾 逼迫她们做妓女
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.67,0:31:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过后来他们发现 直接绑架旅游中的年轻女人…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.75,0:31:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…更为经济 这样可以省下交通费
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.80,0:31:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的小宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.39,0:31:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.14,0:31:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这伙人的作案方式 我们的分析显示…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…从她被绑开始你有96个小时的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.40,0:31:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 否则呢？ - 再也找不到她
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.02,0:31:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.28,0:31:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.66,0:31:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有胡子 六英尺高 右手有月亮和星星的纹身
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.57,0:32:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.04,0:32:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.93,0:32:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.34,0:32:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.47,0:32:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.65,0:34:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.66,0:34:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 他们抓住了阿曼达
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.46,0:34:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.25,0:34:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 他们抓住了她
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.35,0:34:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓住了她
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.68,0:34:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,到隔壁的卧室去 躲在床底下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 躲好了告诉我 - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.57,0:34:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神集中 宝贝 把电话扔在地上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.61,0:34:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中注意力 把你看到的都说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.28,0:34:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,发色 瞳色 身高 疤痕等等 看到的一切 明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.33,0:34:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了 我能听见 记住 全神贯注
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.55,0:35:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了 爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.30,0:35:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.55,0:35:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有胡子 六英尺高 右手有月亮和星星的纹身
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.19,0:35:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.76,0:36:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位旅客请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.40,0:36:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,DU720班机从斯德哥尔摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flight DU720 from Stockholm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.84,0:36:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,已抵达16号登机门\N{\fnArial\fs30}arrived at Gate 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.58,0:36:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.87,0:37:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫彼得 - 我叫英格丽德
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.66,0:37:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 度假？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.13,0:37:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.01,0:37:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这的出租车贵死了 一起搭吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.63,0:37:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 为什么不呢？ - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.09,0:37:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.85,0:37:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 开车
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.64,0:37:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 昨天的那两个美国女孩呢？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.03,0:37:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一根肋骨可会插入你的肺 那两个美国女孩 她们在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.94,0:39:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像以前一样 - 还有其它办法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.07,0:39:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我之间？没了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.70,0:39:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我做文职后 一切看起来不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是指很无聊吧 - 我是说不同
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.03,0:39:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 有点无聊 不过退休了能有趣吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.21,0:39:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 直到我女儿昨天在巴黎失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.75,0:39:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和她朋友在机场就被盯上了 阿尔巴尼亚人干的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.89,0:39:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的？ - 我退休了 又不是死了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.72,0:39:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你不会去报警
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:40:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人告诉我 我有96个小时的时间 而那发生在16个小时前
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.22,0:40:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 首先我们得找到那个盯梢的 - 我找到了 但他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.10,0:40:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到的时候就已经死了？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 你不能这样跑来跑去 把巴黎弄得天翻地覆…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.16,0:40:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有必要 我连埃菲尔铁塔都能掀翻
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.49,0:40:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要忘了你在和谁说话 - 一个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.32,0:40:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但记住 你朋友现在是做文职的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.58,0:40:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「国安局副局长」 了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.25,0:40:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔巴尼亚人？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.46,0:40:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,六 七年前他们从东面过来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.47,0:40:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有15 20个的样子 而现在有几百个了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.01,0:40:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至都不知道他们究竟有多少人 也不知道他们的危险程度
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 哪里可以找到他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.81,0:40:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好先从克利希酒店开始 布莱恩 不要胡来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.59,0:40:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我跟监一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me track someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.55,0:41:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小红帽跟大野狼说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Red Riding Hood told the Big Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.87,0:41:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,「外婆 你的手臂好结实哦」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Grandma, your arms are so sturdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.47,0:41:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大野狼回答…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big wild wolf answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.67,0:41:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩·克劳德 你助理打电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gene Claude, your assistant called.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.54,0:41:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.14,0:41:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.95,0:41:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.79,0:41:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去职业介绍所雇了一个人 租了一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to an employment agency and hired someone to rent a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.66,0:41:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.56,0:41:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没什么风吹草动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there wasn't much commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.46,0:41:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续不了太久 别被他唬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't last too long Don't be fooled by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.94,0:41:39.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克利希）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.67,0:41:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格莱格·米洛斯维克？ - 是的 是的 我是格莱格
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.17,0:41:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史密斯 上车
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.31,0:42:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的简历
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.77,0:42:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,职业介绍所让我来做翻译
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.72,0:42:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 阿尔巴尼亚语翻成英语 你真的会说阿尔巴尼亚语？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.85,0:42:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔巴尼亚语 塞尔维亚语 克罗地亚语 普里什蒂纳发生战争前…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.15,0:42:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …我是个小学老师… - 你的时薪多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.07,0:42:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的时薪？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.53,0:42:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,前三个小时25元每小时 之后涨到…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.86,0:42:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 给 这是10个小时的 等在这
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.79,0:42:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密斯先生 我不明白 我到底要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.45,0:42:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就是在这等着
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.84,0:42:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.42,0:42:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 找伴吗？ - 我喜欢你的衣服 丝质的？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 想知道价钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.06,0:42:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么笔挺 一定是丝质
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.10,0:42:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全凸显了你的自然曲线
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.61,0:42:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准服务40欧元
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.86,0:42:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准服务？能更具体点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.82,0:43:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到家 标准的内容就更广了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.65,0:43:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如亲吻 你知道的 张嘴闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.20,0:43:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要就滚蛋 - 我没说不要
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.37,0:43:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,付钱之前我喜欢问清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.66,0:43:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我买的那个卡拉OK机
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.70,0:43:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会把说明书从头到尾看上好几遍
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.54,0:43:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我管不着 如果你不付钱 我就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.17,0:43:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麻烦？真的？谁要找你麻烦？ - 滚
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.54,0:43:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 听着 我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.39,0:43:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要整套服务 有没有折扣？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.18,0:43:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你已经让我错过了两个客人 - 我叫布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.60,0:43:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪 你快点走 - 我们不是在谈价嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.44,0:43:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东 我发誓 不是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.31,0:43:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟他说… - 你为什么纠缠这个女孩？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.31,0:43:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不关你的事 - 她归我管
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.82,0:43:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不花钱 就是在浪费我们的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.62,0:43:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在谈价呢 - 没有还价 是多少就多少
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.57,0:43:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还欠我那两个走掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.66,0:43:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不欠你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.42,0:43:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 50欧元 否则我揍你 - 好吧 好吧 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.75,0:43:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 50元
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.18,0:44:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这另外50元是因为你是个浑球 滚蛋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.39,0:44:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再让我看到你 我会杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.06,0:44:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密斯先生 我不清楚你要我 为你做什么样的工作 但…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.03,0:44:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的工作是翻译 - 我知道 但翻译什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.16,0:44:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.29,0:44:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻译
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.50,0:44:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在说你 - 说我什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.54,0:44:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不太好听 - 具体点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.38,0:44:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在说…不好意思 史密斯先生 - 你是个浑球
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.47,0:44:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你能不能告诉我为什么要做这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.26,0:44:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻译
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.14,0:44:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人说 香肠吃得他胃痛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.10,0:44:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.48,0:45:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个在说他的祖母以前给过他什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.10,0:45:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的要听这个吗？ - 每句话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.74,0:45:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们在谈论足球 拉齐奥和马赛的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.95,0:45:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们赌输了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.04,0:45:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果我知道目的… - 你最好不要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.75,0:45:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在说足球？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.21,0:45:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人在打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.34,0:45:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得去工地办点事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.80,0:45:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的货物出了点问题
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.01,0:45:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密斯先生 我一点都不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.55,0:45:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不明白最好 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.68,0:45:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的英阿字典 你带来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.93,0:45:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.16,0:47:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.93,0:47:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,从哪弄来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.22,0:47:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪弄来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.51,0:47:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很好 - 谁给你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.73,0:47:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁…谁给你的？ - 我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.36,0:47:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.89,0:48:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.03,0:48:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.00,0:51:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早说过他不可能按兵不动太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you earlier that he couldn't have stood still for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.71,0:51:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.87,0:51:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在行动了 我猜他会甩掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taking action now. I guess he'll get rid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.95,0:51:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,干！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.38,0:52:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦先生 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.25,0:52:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 吉勒斯 你妻子怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.29,0:52:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在看护着
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.00,0:52:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好久不见了 - 很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.34,0:52:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老房间？ - 加一间
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.20,0:54:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.41,0:54:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得谈谈 - 我听着
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.20,0:54:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不先过来看看我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.29,0:54:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到你 你在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.21,0:54:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能很清楚地看到你 听到你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.71,0:54:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们别跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.15,0:54:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 收到讯号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I got the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.83,0:54:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在搜寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.63,0:54:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在查讯号发送地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checking for signal sending location.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.31,0:54:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到我会来 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.68,0:54:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到你会搞得这样一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.14,0:54:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没空考虑乱不乱了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.36,0:54:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 你还有70个小时 - 现在只有56个小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.39,0:54:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.19,0:54:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 现在你一个小时也没了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.03,0:54:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上司要逮捕你 我说服他把你遣送回去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.08,0:54:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国航空001航班 今天2点起飞 头等舱
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.08,0:55:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国政府对于你过去所做贡献的特别招待
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.38,0:55:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我女儿怎么办？ - 跟你说了 我现在是做文职的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.00,0:55:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得听从上司的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.56,0:55:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听 七具尸体 三个住院 一幢大楼被毁
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.39,0:55:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有机场的骚乱
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.89,0:55:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要你坐牢 我已经尽力了 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.39,0:55:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,说抱歉没用 吉恩·克劳德 这次不行
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.69,0:55:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你斗不过政府的 布莱恩 你明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.32,0:55:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想斗 我只是想救回我的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.95,0:55:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一辆拖车 不是大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.34,0:55:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有找到他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.31,0:55:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.30,0:56:06.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿尔巴尼亚实用字典）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.99,0:56:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 别动它
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.32,0:56:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 这是点滴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.28,0:56:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是中和毒品的药物
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.08,0:56:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.46,0:56:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从哪弄来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.29,0:56:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪弄来这件外套？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.67,0:56:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她那弄来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.47,0:56:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个女孩的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.76,0:56:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没偷
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.59,0:56:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很冷 是她给我的 - 在哪里？她在哪里给你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.94,0:56:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 房子里 - 哪座房子？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.60,0:56:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有扇红门的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.28,0:56:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.66,0:57:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说那是个派对
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.96,0:57:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你外套的那个女孩在房子里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.54,0:57:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.34,0:57:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.84,0:57:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.48,0:57:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须找到那座房子 你知道在哪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.99,0:57:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.16,0:57:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 有事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.00,0:57:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要见你们老板 - 老板不在
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.67,0:58:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没做什么非法的事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.18,0:58:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,按一下 30个特工就会出现在这…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.27,0:58:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你们根本没时间卷铺盖走人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.77,0:58:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍人了 再浪费我时间 小心我干掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.78,0:58:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.04,0:58:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带着武器？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.62,0:58:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手上拿着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.23,0:59:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑咖啡 一块糖 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.95,0:59:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.63,0:59:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来谈价钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.42,0:59:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和梅肯先生谈过了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.84,0:59:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅肯先生调到别的区了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.17,0:59:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来重新谈的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.85,0:59:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得我有道理的话 那我接着说了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.26,0:59:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡不错 我们利用卫星全天24小时监视你们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.69,0:59:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说的每句话 做的每件事 我们都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.48,0:59:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道 光是改变地球上空200米…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.99,0:59:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…轨道卫星的镜头角度 就要花多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.83,0:59:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且价格还在上涨
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.37,0:59:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的费用上涨 随之你们的费用也得上涨 再正常不过了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.54,0:59:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 你们谁是马科？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.04,0:59:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问这干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.04,0:59:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说马科是这的老大
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.75,1:00:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是马科
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.50,1:00:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科来自卓帕加
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.30,1:00:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都来自卓帕加
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.35,1:00:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们那么想玩游戏 那么费用上升10%
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.85,1:00:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要以为我们是移民就可以敲诈我们 我们懂法律
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敲诈你们是因为你们做了违法的事
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.15,1:00:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们喜欢以哪项罪名被捕？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.81,1:00:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,贩毒 绑架 卖淫？随你们挑
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.03,1:00:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来到这个国家 利用这个国家…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.78,1:00:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们宽容并不代表我们懦弱无助
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.24,1:00:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的傲慢无礼激怒了我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.07,1:00:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此 费用提升10%
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.25,1:00:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你们要谈正事还是继续玩？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.29,1:00:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多少？ - 20%
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.30,1:00:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我保证一年内不会上涨
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.34,1:00:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把罐子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the jar.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.06,1:00:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你们的语言如何说「糖」？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.53,1:01:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做了明智的决定 先生们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.96,1:01:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月后见
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.04,1:01:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个朋友给我的 是阿尔巴尼亚语 不介意翻一下吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.56,1:01:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.64,1:01:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运 - 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.56,1:01:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运 祝你好运 - 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.24,1:01:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得我了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.75,1:01:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前我们通过电话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.29,1:02:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你我会找到你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.73,1:03:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.16,1:03:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.70,1:03:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.28,1:04:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你集中精神
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.21,1:04:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神集中了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.93,1:04:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女孩在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.72,1:04:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.00,1:04:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我们以前会外包这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.00,1:04:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们发现 我们外包的那些国家…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.80,1:04:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…电网都不怎么稳定 典型的第三世界
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.34,1:05:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你按了开关 却没有电…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.84,1:05:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…真是气死人 没办法 就只能拔指甲
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.06,1:05:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在裸露的皮肤上洒酸溶液
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.56,1:05:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些只会造成反效果
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.15,1:05:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在这里 电力很稳定
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.98,1:05:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的电流源源不断
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.49,1:05:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻按开关 电力就能持续一整天
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.86,1:05:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.14,1:05:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没什么时间可以浪费 卓帕加的马科
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.56,1:05:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我 否则这个开关会一直开着…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.02,1:05:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…直到他们付不出电费而关掉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.24,1:05:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.07,1:06:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会留着处女 我们会卖了她们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.74,1:06:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是处女 可以卖一大笔
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.08,1:06:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我女儿卖了？你把她卖了？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.25,1:06:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖给谁了？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.58,1:06:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.67,1:06:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 圣·嘉力
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.05,1:06:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣·嘉力
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.51,1:06:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣·嘉力？圣·嘉力 是个人 还是个地方？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.67,1:06:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个人 帕特里斯·圣·嘉力
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.89,1:06:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕特里斯·圣·嘉力
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.10,1:06:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪能找到他？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.39,1:06:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.02,1:06:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.94,1:06:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你！我真的不知道！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.36,1:06:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道！不！求求你！求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.53,1:06:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.54,1:06:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.79,1:06:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.04,1:06:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能放过你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.24,1:07:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.34,1:07:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.94,1:07:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, babies.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.97,1:07:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.92,1:07:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,烤鸡好香哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roasted chicken is so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.48,1:07:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看谁来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.15,1:07:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 真是意外啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.94,1:07:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩·克劳德
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.15,1:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们在等你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.79,1:07:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快带他们去睡觉 我们还能吃顿热乎乎的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.29,1:07:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 来帮下忙？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.99,1:07:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 我马上来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.44,1:08:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正跟布莱恩说 你换了新工作后…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.78,1:08:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一切变得好多了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.12,1:08:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,每晚回家吃饭 见到孩子们的时间也多了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.12,1:08:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,每晚回家 看着孩子们 一定很幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.38,1:08:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩在考虑搬家
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.88,1:08:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.54,1:08:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,搬到巴黎 他在看房子了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.50,1:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要鸡胸还鸡腿？ - 鸡腿 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.34,1:08:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有看上的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.85,1:08:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 有啊 在天堂街第十区
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.55,1:08:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,住那的人认识你的一个同事
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.26,1:08:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位梅肯先生 你认识吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.40,1:08:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 亨利 我都叫他紧张先生
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.86,1:08:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是一副会有麻烦的样子 要胡萝卜吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.73,1:08:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查到了 吉恩·克劳德
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.90,1:08:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.78,1:08:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你没趟进这浑水
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.41,1:08:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么浑水？ - 现在不该说这些 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.41,1:08:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你掺合进来了？ - 掺合进什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.17,1:08:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.83,1:08:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是不是？ - 我的薪水是X 我的开支是Y
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.58,1:09:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能养家…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.83,1:09:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我不在乎从哪弄钱
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.59,1:09:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那样卷进来的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.68,1:09:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我的家人呢？ - 我告诉你…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.84,1:09:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…只要不惹麻烦 我会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.43,1:09:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是帕特里斯·圣·嘉力？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.93,1:09:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我也不关心 我载你去机场
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.69,1:09:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩·克劳德
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.03,1:09:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 伊莎贝尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Isabel.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.80,1:09:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.40,1:09:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 晚餐结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.23,1:09:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还没吃完 - 不 你吃完了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.27,1:09:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！ - 不 我还没有
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.86,1:09:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你做文职的后果 你忘了些事
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.29,1:09:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就如你都忘了 上了弹的枪拿在手上的重量
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.83,1:09:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莎贝尔！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.96,1:09:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个王八蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.42,1:09:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是皮肉伤
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.75,1:09:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你再不说 就会看到你最不想看的…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.63,1:09:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我会射穿她的脑门
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.80,1:09:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 告诉我谁是帕特里斯·圣·嘉力
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.48,1:10:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以少受点苦…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.45,1:10:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…只要你多关心点我女儿 而不是你的职位
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.74,1:10:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请替我向你妻子道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.35,1:11:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能为您效劳吗？ - 我来找圣·嘉力先生
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.39,1:11:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我您的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.94,1:11:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 上面没有您的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.03,1:11:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 请再检查一次
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.65,1:11:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.99,1:12:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗 先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.88,1:12:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您点的香槟 - 没错 放这吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.14,1:12:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在出价5万 5万
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.23,1:12:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,5万
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.81,1:12:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,10万 10万
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.91,1:12:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,10万 15万
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.16,1:13:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在出价15万
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.99,1:13:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的香槟 先生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.92,1:13:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,20万 现在出价20万 25万
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.79,1:13:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要为您倒酒吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.00,1:13:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 现在出价25万
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.17,1:13:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,25万
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.50,1:13:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,25万成交
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.43,1:13:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,阁下 出价如你所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bid is as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.53,1:13:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个物件要拍卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is another item to be auctioned off.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.86,1:13:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.79,1:13:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一件拍品
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.11,1:13:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,惯例 最好的留到最后
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.95,1:13:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,说英语 会一点法语
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.28,1:13:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是处女
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.67,1:13:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 出去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.30,1:13:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,起价为10万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.51,1:14:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,10万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.57,1:14:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,10万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.57,1:14:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说… - 我听到了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.90,1:14:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,买下她
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.40,1:14:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在出价10万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.24,1:14:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 买下她 - 15万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.21,1:14:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,20万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.50,1:14:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,25万 30万 35万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.37,1:14:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,35万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.22,1:14:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,40万 40万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.92,1:14:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,45万 45万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.63,1:14:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,45万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.22,1:14:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,45万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.43,1:14:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,50万 50万
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.60,1:14:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,50万 成交
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.06,1:14:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的拍卖到此结束 谢谢各位的惠顾
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.24,1:14:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以直接领走你的商品 - 走
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.36,1:15:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你逃不掉的 - 要是你想活着 你就得保证我也活着
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.20,1:15:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.88,1:15:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你不是这个人 但我们该怎么叫你？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.64,1:15:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么叫你不重要…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.72,1:15:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…重要的是你来这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.57,1:15:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后那女孩 我是她父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.07,1:15:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 我的天 - 把她还给我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.48,1:15:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我希望我能
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.95,1:15:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我也是个父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.83,1:15:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两个儿子 一个女儿…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.99,1:15:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但是我必须告诉你 不管你叫什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.20,1:15:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是生意
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.71,1:15:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是和特殊客户…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.63,1:15:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …做的特殊生意 - 我会付钱
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.59,1:16:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种生意 你不能退款 退货…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.21,1:16:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…没有折扣 回购 一经售出便成定局
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.47,1:16:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了决定权 这是我们唯一的一条规则
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.26,1:16:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 安静点 我还有客人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.99,1:17:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去看看 我让他们「安静点」…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.54,1:17:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …他们听不懂吗？ - 是 先生
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.44,1:17:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们可以解决的 我明白你的感受
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.35,1:17:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈 怎么样？我们会找到办法的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.32,1:17:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.11,1:17:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪？ - 别
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.57,1:17:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请理解 请试着…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.54,1:17:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,码头那有条船
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.83,1:18:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你明白
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.46,1:18:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是生意 我们无冤无仇的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.05,1:18:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有仇了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.71,1:20:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.71,1:21:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带这几个女孩去见老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take these girls to see the boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.05,1:22:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.89,1:22:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人入侵 搜船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone invaded and searched the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.07,1:22:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.53,1:22:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,3号 出了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.3, What happened on the third?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.48,1:22:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里 3号？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you? No.3.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.69,1:23:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在房里比较安全 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safer to stay in the room, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.61,1:23:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事？是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.58,1:23:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩的爸爸 他要带她回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl's father. He's taking her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.24,1:23:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理那条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle that dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.85,1:25:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.86,1:25:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.36,1:25:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来救我了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.03,1:25:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来救我了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.28,1:25:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我会的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.31,1:26:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘客们请注意 如果各位在等你们的大号行李箱…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.95,1:26:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.57,1:26:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.96,1:26:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.92,1:26:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 来 我帮你拿
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.42,1:26:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 如果你需要什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.71,1:26:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经拥有了我想要的一切
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.05,1:26:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.80,1:26:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图尔特
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.80,1:26:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.06,1:26:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 游客们 你们不用…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.15,1:26:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.11,1:26:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定不用载你一程？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.25,1:27:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系 我可以叫车 谢谢 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.17,1:27:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 爸爸 - 我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.49,1:27:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是哪？ - 跟你说了 这是一个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.45,1:27:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.33,1:27:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟你说「你好」时 通常应礼貌地回应「你好」
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.55,1:27:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.84,1:27:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你想当歌手
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.46,1:27:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.85,1:27:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧 让我们听听你唱得如何
